Traces arrive over OTLP/HTTP from `src/lib/otel.ts` and are batched by Alloy before Tempo. W3C `traceparent` is honoured on inbound requests, so a trace survives across service hops.

```
{ resource.service.name = "mechanical-matter" }
{ resource.service.name = "mechanical-matter" && status = error }
{ resource.service.name = "mechanical-matter" && duration > 1s }
{ span.http.status_code >= 500 }
{ span.db.system = "postgresql" && duration > 250ms }
```
